cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use lefsim in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lefsim: event-driven simulation of loop-extruding factors"
abstract: >-
  An action-based stochastic simulator of loop-extruding factors (LEFs) on a 1D
  chromatin lattice with CTCF barriers, with a Rust core and bindings for Python
  and the browser (WebAssembly).
authors:
  - given-names: Nezar
    family-names: Abdennur
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5814-0864"
    affiliation: "UMass Chan Medical School"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23481501
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdenlab/lefsim"
url: "https://abdenlab.github.io/lefsim/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - loop extrusion
  - chromatin
  - cohesin
  - CTCF
  - stochastic simulation
  - 3D genome
